            "content_html": "<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">window.alert()</code> <a href=\"https://www.chromestatus.com/feature/5148698084376576\" rel=\"nofollow\">doesn't work cross-origin in Chrome any more</a>, meaning that any of our live samples that rely on <code class=\"notranslate\">alert()</code> are now broken.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See also <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"959310145\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/7553\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/7553/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/7553\">#7553</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This is (I think) all the live samples in Web/API that use <code class=\"notranslate\">alert()</code> in a live sample (list now maintained by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Josh-Cena/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Josh-Cena\">@Josh-Cena</a>):</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Build_the_brick_field\" rel=\"nofollow\">Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Build_the_brick_field</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Collision_detection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Collision_detection</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Finishing_up\" rel=\"nofollow\">Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Finishing_up</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Game_over\" rel=\"nofollow\">Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Game_over</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Mouse_controls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Mouse_controls</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Track_the_score_and_win\" rel=\"nofollow\">Games/Tutorials/2D_Breakout_game_pure_JavaScript/Track_the_score_and_win</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/JavaScript/First_steps/Variables\" rel=\"nofollow\">Learn/JavaScript/First_steps/Variables</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2380463617\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/34487\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/34487/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/34487\">#34487</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/MDN/Writing_guidelines/Page_structures/Live_samples\" rel=\"nofollow\"