.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/mouseevent\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web/API/MouseEvent</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Notifications_API/Using_the_Notifications_API\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web/API/Notifications_API/Using_the_Notifications_API</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2397966956\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/34734\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/34734/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/34734\">#34734</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebGL_API/By_example/Simple_color_animation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web/API/WebGL_API/By_example/Simple_color_animation</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebGL_API/By_example/Clearing_by_clicking\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web/API/WebGL_API/By_example/Clearing_by_clicking</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/window/find\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web/API/Window/find</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/windoworworkerglobalscope/settimeout\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web/API/WindowOrWorkerGlobalScope/setTimeout</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"959418868\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/7560\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/7560/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/7560\">#7560</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">(I might have missed some).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In addition, the following ones use <code class=\"notranslate\">prompt()</code> and are also broken:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/JavaScript/First_steps/Strings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Learn/JavaScript/First_steps/Strings</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/JavaScript/First_steps/What_is_JavaScript\" rel=\"nofollow\">Learn/JavaScript/First_steps/What_is_JavaScript</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\"> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLTextAreaElement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web/API/HTMLTextAreaElement</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We should replace all of these with some alternative. A common alternative is to write the output into an element in the example's document.</p>",
